  "instructions": [
    "Heat olive oil in a pan over medium heat.",
    "Add minced garlic and grated ginger, cooking for 1 minute until fragrant.",
    "Add chopped minari and cook for 3-4 minutes, until slightly tender.",
    "In a small bowl, whisk together miso paste, lemon juice, and rice vinegar. Pour the marinade over the minari and stir to combine.",
    "Cook for an additional 2-3 minutes, until the flavors have melded together and the minari is tender.",
    "Season with salt and black pepper to taste.",
    "Serve hot, wrapped in a pandan leaf for a flavorful and nutritious meal."
